          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A recorded glimpse, not time spent. These samples don't establish app opens, reads or scrolls.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un aperçu enregistré, pas un temps passé. Ces échantillons n’établissent ni ouvertures d’apps, ni lectures, ni défilements."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A recorded glimpse, not time spent. These samples don't establish app opens, reads or scrolls."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A recording doesn't tell us whether a person or automation caused the activity. Keep Unsure when you don't know.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un enregistrement ne dit pas si l’activité vient d’une personne ou d’une automatisation. Gardez « Incertain » si vous ne savez pas."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A recording doesn't tell us whether a person or automation caused the activity. Keep Unsure when you don't know."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A recording is sampled at up to 24 moments, so short clips work best and quick actions may be missed. Visible text helps suggest a routine; it doesn't reveal every tap or intention.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un enregistrement est échantillonné sur 24 moments au maximum : les clips courts fonctionnent mieux et les actions rapides peuvent être manquées. Le texte visible aide à suggérer une routine ; il ne révèle pas chaque toucher ni chaque intention."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A recording is sampled at up to 24 moments, so short clips work best and quick actions may be missed. Visible text helps suggest a routine; it doesn't reveal every tap or intention."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A removal is already in progress. Nothing more was removed.": {
