    "Adding an API action to a routine saves its parameters. Local forgetting removes the connection token and saved shortcut names; remote grants and server receipt metadata remain separately managed. Disconnect accounts in Connections → API to request revocation.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ajouter une action API à une routine enregistre ses paramètres. L’oubli local supprime le jeton de connexion et les noms des raccourcis ; les autorisations distantes et les métadonnées du serveur restent gérées séparément. Déconnectez les comptes dans Connexions → API pour demander leur révocation."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Adding an API action to a routine saves its parameters. Local forgetting removes the connection token and saved shortcut names; remote grants and server receipt metadata remain separately managed. Disconnect accounts in Connections → API to request revocation."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adding an account action to your routine saves its details. Forgetting local data removes access from this iPhone; service permissions and server receipts are managed separately. To disconnect an account, open its page in Apps & accounts.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ajouter une action d’un compte à votre routine enregistre ses détails. L’oubli des données locales retire l’accès depuis cet iPhone ; les autorisations des services et les reçus du serveur se gèrent séparément. Pour déconnecter un compte, ouvrez sa page dans Apps et comptes."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Adding an account action to your routine saves its details. Forgetting local data removes access from this iPhone; service permissions and server receipts are managed separately. To disconnect an account, open its page in Apps & accounts."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adding this excerpt needs room in your routine. Remove a moment in Routine first.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
