    "Apple asks once (Continue, then Face ID). Only one app on this iPhone can hold this access. Nothing changes until you approve.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple demande une seule fois (Continuer, puis Face ID). Une seule app de cet iPhone peut avoir cet accès. Rien ne change avant votre accord."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple asks once (Continue, then Face ID). Only one app on this iPhone can hold this access. Nothing changes until you approve."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple permissions, installed voices, Shortcuts and device backups are managed separately. Removing local data doesn't change them or erase copies outside this app.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les autorisations Apple, les voix installées, Raccourcis et les sauvegardes de l’appareil sont gérés séparément. Supprimer les données locales ne les modifie pas et n’efface pas les copies hors de cette app."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple permissions, installed voices, Shortcuts and device backups are managed separately. Removing local data doesn't change them or erase copies outside this app."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple requires full calendar access to read events. MORE reads only the calendars you select; this recap doesn't change them.": {
