    "Each observation is saved on this device, with its original text and your corrections kept separately. Find earlier observations in Review. Clear this observation removes its original, corrections, sampled text and screen interpretation. Evidence already attached to a saved routine remains with it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chaque observation est enregistrée sur cet appareil, son texte d’origine et vos corrections étant conservés séparément. Retrouvez les observations précédentes dans Historique. « Effacer cette observation » supprime l’original, les corrections, le texte échantillonné et l’interprétation de l’écran. Les éléments déjà liés à une routine enregistrée restent avec elle."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each observation is saved on this device, with its original text and your corrections kept separately. Find earlier observations in Review. Clear this observation removes its original, corrections, sampled text and screen interpretation. Evidence already attached to a saved routine remains with it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each observation is saved on this device, with its original text and your corrections kept separately. Review the current observation here before asking for a suggestion. Clear this observation removes its original, corrections, sampled text and screen interpretation. Evidence already attached to a saved routine remains with it.": {
