            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MORE guides native app steps. Inside MORE’s browser, you can ask it to read supported pages or move to the next video."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MORE keeps its learning on this device. You choose when to connect Apple apps and what to keep.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MORE garde son apprentissage sur cet appareil. Vous choisissez quand connecter les apps Apple et ce que vous gardez."
