          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MORE keeps its learning on this device. You choose when to connect Apple apps and what to keep."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MORE looks at the minutes you spent in each app over the last week and finds your mornings. Only app names and minutes are kept, on this iPhone. No messages, no screens, no websites.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MORE regarde les minutes passées dans chaque app la semaine dernière et retrouve vos matins. Seuls les noms d’apps et les minutes sont gardés, sur cet iPhone. Aucun message, aucun écran, aucun site web."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MORE looks at the minutes you spent in each app over the last week and finds your mornings. Only app names and minutes are kept, on this iPhone. No messages, no screens, no websites."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MORE prepares this recap when you open the app and checks it again before speaking. Overnight preparation isn't guaranteed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MORE prépare ce récap à l’ouverture de l’app et le vérifie à nouveau avant de le lire. La préparation pendant la nuit n’est pas garantie."
          }
        },
        "en": {
