    "Off keeps every observation until you remove it. When an age is chosen, nothing is removed until you review the list and confirm. Quotations in a routine you approved and moments you chose to keep stay.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Désactivé : chaque observation reste jusqu’à ce que vous la supprimiez. Si vous choisissez une durée, rien n’est supprimé avant que vous ayez vérifié la liste et confirmé. Les citations d’une routine que vous avez approuvée et les moments que vous avez choisi de garder restent."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Off keeps every observation until you remove it. When an age is chosen, nothing is removed until you review the list and confirm. Quotations in a routine you approved and moments you chose to keep stay."
          }
        }
      }
    },
