    "Screen Time gives minutes per hour, not the order inside an hour. So the order is estimated: the app you open most often from the Lock Screen comes first, then the others by hour, then by minutes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Temps d’écran donne des minutes par heure, pas l’ordre dans l’heure. L’ordre est donc estimé : l’app que vous ouvrez le plus souvent depuis l’écran verrouillé vient d’abord, puis les autres par heure, puis par minutes."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Screen Time gives minutes per hour, not the order inside an hour. So the order is estimated: the app you open most often from the Lock Screen comes first, then the others by hour, then by minutes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
