    "Try opening two connected apps and returning to the first, then open Review. Counts appear after those automations actually run. Screen recordings you make in MORE also use these times to name the app on each sampled screen. This setup does not start screen recording or read messages.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Essayez d’ouvrir deux apps connectées puis de revenir à la première, puis ouvrez Relire. Les comptes apparaissent une fois les automatisations exécutées. Les enregistrements d’écran faits dans MORE utilisent aussi ces heures pour nommer l’app de chaque écran échantillonné. Cette configuration ne lance pas d’enregistrement d’écran et ne lit pas vos messages."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Try opening two connected apps and returning to the first, then open Review. Counts appear after those automations actually run. Screen recordings you make in MORE also use these times to name the app on each sampled screen. This setup does not start screen recording or read messages."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Try opening two connected apps and returning to the first, then open Review. Counts appear after those automations actually run. This setup does not start screen recording or read messages.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
