    "When recording finishes, visible text is extracted and saved locally. Review the text, then choose whether to ask Apple Intelligence for a routine suggestion. Your routine changes only after you approve. The video stays on this device until its extracted text is saved, or until you discard it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "À la fin de l’enregistrement, le texte visible est extrait et enregistré localement. Relisez le texte, puis choisissez si vous voulez demander une suggestion de routine à Apple Intelligence. Votre routine ne change qu’après votre approbation. La vidéo reste sur cet appareil jusqu’à l’enregistrement de son texte extrait, ou jusqu’à ce que vous la supprimiez."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When recording finishes, visible text is extracted and saved locally. Review the text, then choose whether to ask Apple Intelligence for a routine suggestion. Your routine changes only after you approve. The video stays on this device until its extracted text is saved, or until you discard it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
