    },
    "Beginning sends the passages MORE reads to ElevenLabs to produce the voice: routine information and readings you choose to play, including selected messages, calendar or Health measurements. This reading sends no microphone audio, video or complete Health history. Consent applies to this morning; your selected model keeps its own settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Beginning sends the passages MORE reads to ElevenLabs to produce the voice: routine information and readings you choose to play, including selected messages, calendar or Health measurements. This reading sends no microphone audio, video or complete Health history. Consent applies to this morning; your selected model keeps its own settings."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "En commençant, vous envoyez les passages que MORE lit à ElevenLabs pour produire la voix : informations de votre routine et lectures que vous lancez, y compris les messages, calendrier ou mesures Santé choisis. Cette lecture n’envoie ni microphone, ni vidéo, ni historique Santé complet. L’accord vaut pour ce matin ; le modèle choisi garde ses propres réglages."
          }
        }
      }
    },
