            "value": "Ces connexions de compte facultatives proposent d’autres actions. Vous pouvez utiliser les sites ci-dessus sans les configurer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To use Slack in the built-in browser, choose Slack above. This additional account connection is optional.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
