          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can sign in when a service first opens during learning or your routine. MORE keeps that browser session on this iPhone for your next mornings. You can also open a service here.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You can sign in when a service first opens during learning or your routine. MORE keeps that browser session on this iPhone for your next mornings. You can also open a service here."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vous pouvez vous connecter quand un service s’ouvre pour la première fois pendant l’apprentissage ou votre routine. MORE conserve cette session sur cet iPhone pour vos prochains matins. Vous pouvez aussi ouvrir un service ici."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your confirmation keeps this session available in MORE. Choose the actions in your routine to use the browser hands-free; MORE asks for your instruction before sending a reply. A sign-in alone does not verify that every page works.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your confirmation keeps this session available in MORE. Choose the actions in your routine to use the browser hands-free; MORE asks for your instruction before sending a reply. A sign-in alone does not verify that every page works."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Votre confirmation garde cette session disponible dans MORE. Choisissez les actions dans votre routine pour utiliser le navigateur mains libres ; MORE attend votre demande avant d’envoyer une réponse. Une connexion seule ne vérifie pas le fonctionnement de chaque page."
          }
        }
      }
    },
